  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"695\">\n<p data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"695\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"693\">Hemoglobin E mutation (&beta;26 Glu&rarr;Lys)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"839\">\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"839\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Useful in diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"745\">Hemoglobin E disease</strong>, <strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"769\">Hemoglobin E trait</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"811\">compound heterozygous conditions</strong> (e.g., HbE/&beta;-thalassemia)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"904\">\n<p data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"904\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Important for <strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"878\">genetic counseling</strong> and <strong data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"904\">carrier screening</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
